{{apichanges|3.4.2|prev=3.4.1|next=3.4.3}}

==Summary==
* The client has pulled in many API changes from [[Patch 10.1.0/API changes|Patch 10.1.0]].
* The new Settings panel introduced in Dragonflight is now also used in Classic.

==Resources==
* TOC: <code>30402</code>
* Diffs: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/compare/3.4.1..classic_ptr wow-ui-source], [https://github.com/Ketho/BlizzardInterfaceResources/compare/3.4.1..3.4.2 BlizzardInterfaceResources]
* Official patch notes: [https://eu.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wrath-classic-patch-notes-version-342/454361#user-interface-11 Wrath Classic Patch Notes Version 3.4.2]

